		"description": {
			"value": "<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend a spell slot to deal &amp;reference[thunder] damage and attempt to throw the target, in addition to the weapon's damage.</p><p><strong>[[/save str]]{Strength Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes [[/damage 3d6 thunder]] damage* and is knocked &amp;reference[prone apply=false]{prone} and pushed 5 ft. in a direction of your choice.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> [[/damage 3d6 thunder]] damage, no other effect.*</p></li></ul><p><strong>*Using Higher Level Spell Slots:</strong> Damage increases by [[/r 1d6]] for each spell level above 2nd.</p>",
